### List all claims (VS Code REST Client or any HTTP client; run `npm run watch` first)
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/expense/Claims

### The service description
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/expense/$metadata

### Claims above 10, only title and amount, with a count
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/expense/Claims?$filter=amount gt 10&$select=title,amount&$count=true
